Release is blocked:
- Upgrade React Native to a supported release with 16 KB native-library support.
- Configure privacyPolicyUrl with your live public HTTPS page.
- Configure termsUrl with your live public HTTPS page.
- Configure supportUrl with your live public HTTPS page.
- Set productionApiUrl to your deployed HTTPS API origin (no path, credentials, query or fragment).
- Confirm your permanent application identifiers in build-config.json.
- Set androidApplicationId to your permanent release identifier.
- API 36 requires Android Gradle Plugin 8.9.1 or newer; upgrade the coordinated native toolchain.
- Configure KATKEE_UPLOAD_STORE_FILE in your private build environment.
- Configure KATKEE_UPLOAD_STORE_PASSWORD in your private build environment.
- Configure KATKEE_UPLOAD_KEY_ALIAS in your private build environment.
- Configure KATKEE_UPLOAD_KEY_PASSWORD in your private build environment.
